# L §4.3 rule 3: a def that reads anything law-dated and states no at "is refused at load (LOAD-LAWDATE)".
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"

input rate: int

def y: int = rate

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  rate = 1
=== expect
refused: LOAD-LAWDATE ...
